# Discovery and local-test placeholders only. There is no static TURN environment variable of any
# kind — TURN credentials are never a client-side config value. They are short-lived, minted
# server-side by the Dedicated Server, and pushed dynamically over the already-authenticated
# realtime connection (see docs/CONFIGURATION.md and docs/adr/0023-turn-rest-credential-minting-architecture.md).
# A self-hosted deployment's own TURN configuration lives in infrastructure/docker/.env.example
# instead (DISCO_VOADOR_TURN_SHARED_SECRET, DISCO_VOADOR_TURN_URLS), never here.
SIGNALING_URL=
STUN_URL=
